# Everything here is generated by scripts/plot_output.py from the .json files
# in ../output/, in one subdirectory per field (P/, U/, V/, Psi/, phi_0/...).
# Regenerating is cheap; committing PNGs is not.
#
# This file is the one exception to its own rule, and exists so git keeps the
# directory itself. The plotting script writes straight into these
# subdirectories and does not create them, so the folder has to survive a
# fresh clone.
*
!.gitignore
